Cell["\<\
Check: {{3., 4.}, {0.3, 0.4}, 1., 0.990}. A small gradient is left alone; \
clipping by the norm keeps the direction (cosine 1), clamping components does \
not (0.990).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a154910c-821c-4086-b8ee-e9b0ec8411e3"],

Cell["7.3 The learning-rate schedule", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"46adb98a-a445-46f4-94b5-38f3cd0eb71e"],

Cell["\<\
Plain stochastic gradient descent without momentum, batches of 128 sentences, \
learning rate 0.7. After 5 epochs the rate is halved every half epoch, and \
training stops after 7.5 epochs.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"71df56e8-084a-4de7-90cf-1da2755c7e2c"],

