Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Fig. 5. ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.83, 0.34, 0.11]],
 "The search tree of the toy model, with each step\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
probability on its edge. Greedy follows the dashed path; the beam of width 2 \
also keeps B and finds the better output."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"322affc7-208a-4511-9453-63bf3ebd7fd1"],

Cell["9. How big is the paper\[CloseCurlyQuote]s model?", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fa50f6d9-62ab-4bc1-bac5-52f1059fc3e7"],

Cell["\<\
An LSTM layer with n\:1d62\:2099 inputs and n cells has four gates, each with \
an n \[Times] n\:1d62\:2099 input matrix, an n \[Times] n state matrix and n \
biases: 4(n n\:1d62\:2099 + n\.b2 + n) parameters.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f87b94e5-ae42-47df-8e13-f9cc70357a10"],

Cell["\<\
One layer of 1000 cells reading 1000 numbers: 4 \[Times] (1 000 000 + 1 000 \
000 + 1000) = 8 004 000. Eight such layers (4 encoder, 4 decoder) make 64 032 \
000. The embeddings add 160 000 \[Times] 1000 (source) and 80 000 \[Times] \
1000 (target), 240 000 000 in all. The softmax adds 80 000 \[Times] 1000 + 80 \
000 = 80 080 000. Total: 240 000 000 + 64 032 000 + 80 080 000 = 384 112 000, \
the paper\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]384M parameters\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. Most of them are in the vocabulary, not in the \
LSTMs.\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.83, 0.34, 0.11],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"e9d8672a-4b15-442d-a4a0-a10549ac735d"],

